cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "Code and data for Position Matters: Evaluating Large Language Models as SQL Injection Detectors Across Deployment Positions"
abstract: >-
  Corpus, run logs, and code for the IEEE BigData 2026 paper "Position Matters:
  Evaluating Large Language Models as SQL Injection Detectors Across Deployment
  Positions". Two LLM detectors, a frontier API model and a locally hosted 7B
  model, judged 213 items at three deployment positions (review-time, runtime
  gatekeeper, and post-hoc), giving 3,834 logged verdicts. The code is under the
  MIT License; the data, run logs, and tables are under CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA).
